{"id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-hierarchical-truth.md","title":"可编码分层语言上的逐句真理记录","display":"df-hierarchical-truth — 可编码分层语言上的逐句真理记录","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","aliases":["91-df-hierarchical-truth","91-df-hierarchical-T","91-df-Tarski-hierarchy"],"display":"df-hierarchical-truth — 可编码分层语言上的逐句真理记录","depends_on":["[[91-df-ramified-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-hierarchical-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-hierarchical-truth</span><span>91-df-hierarchical-T</span><span>91-df-Tarski-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hierarchical-truth — 可编码分层语言上的逐句真理记录"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"706acac2c3076a7b\" href=\"?note=706acac2c3076a7b\" title=\"91-df-ramified-truth\">91-df-ramified-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定原书有效序数记法内的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\le\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\gamma\\le\\Gamma_0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\gamma\\}\">\\(I=\\{\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\gamma\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"706acac2c3076a7b\" href=\"?note=706acac2c3076a7b\" title=\"91-df-ramified-truth\">91-df-ramified-truth</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\\)</span> 为逐句模式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HierT}(I)\">\\(\\mathrm{HierT}(I)\\)</span> 为本地记录；语言层号统一采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{T_\\alpha(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{T_\\alpha(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HierT}(I)\\coloneqq\\left(\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha,\\langle\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha},T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HierT}(I)\\coloneqq\\left(\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}\\mathrm{TB}_\\alpha,\\langle\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha},T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一级双条件实例不含自己的 T_α，但整个扩张语言可以写 T_α 的自应用原子或对角句；限制在公理域，不是禁止一元谓词的句法形成。\n旧稿取任意序数指标集却对全部句子使用自然数 Gödel 编码，未保证可编码性，现复用原书有效层级。该记录只含逐句去引号，不等于 RT 的八类编码组合句、累积公理和全语言归纳系统。\n不由此抽象记录推断自然语言表达限制、唯一最佳层或所有层都对 PA 保守。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 9.1–9.2，印刷页 112–114，PDF 页 123–125。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ramified-truth","status":"resolved","id":"706acac2c3076a7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","loca